WEBVTT

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:33.230
<b>Flowers of Evil</b>

00:01:24.060 --> 00:01:33.230
<b>Episode 8 of 13</b>

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:10.310
I can't fall asleep...

00:02:10.700 --> 00:02:12.980
I... I...

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:14.420
Kasuga-kun,

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:16.990
good morning.

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:19.480
I haven't felt this good in a long time!

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:20.910
Did you see the looks on their faces?

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:22.870
Be proud.

00:02:22.870 --> 00:02:25.180
You finally dropped the first layer of your mask.

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:10.260
Well, I live over that way.

00:09:15.820 --> 00:09:18.160
Say, Nakamura-san?

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.480
In a few more hours,

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:25.880
everyone will see the classroom.

00:09:28.010 --> 00:09:29.500
Including Saeki-san...

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.980
What do you think will happen?

00:09:46.640 --> 00:09:48.230
I can't wait.

00:09:58.870 --> 00:10:00.300
See you later today.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:03.930
Yeah...

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:06.690
Later today.

00:10:48.040 --> 00:10:49.970
<i>I can't fall asleep...</i>

00:10:50.860 --> 00:10:53.670
<i>I... I...</i>

00:10:55.290 --> 00:10:57.440
<i>I can no longer go back.</i>

00:10:58.250 --> 00:11:04.880
<i>Today, my life as a normal 
person will come to an end.</i>

00:11:07.760 --> 00:11:10.840
Whoa, you startled me!

00:11:10.840 --> 00:11:11.980
What is this, Takao?

00:11:11.980 --> 00:11:13.420
You're already up?

00:11:13.420 --> 00:11:16.100
Usually, you're in bed until the last second.

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:19.330
You seriously almost scared me to death...

00:11:19.330 --> 00:11:19.780
Ah!

00:11:22.040 --> 00:11:25.530
Don't you change to summer uniforms today? 
I ironed it for you.

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:15.410
Gross...

00:13:13.860 --> 00:13:15.410
Are you crazy?

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:16.640
Don't look at me.

00:13:15.690 --> 00:13:16.640
Stay away.

00:13:16.640 --> 00:13:18.080
Get lost.

00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:17.520
You'll get us dirty.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.260
Shit for brains.

00:13:18.600 --> 00:13:20.220
What's wrong with you?

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:20.220
Eww...

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:21.790
You're gonna get it!

00:13:21.790 --> 00:13:23.820
Don't come to school anymore!

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:25.680
Kasuga-kun...

00:13:26.730 --> 00:13:28.320
Why?

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.170
Why?

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.230
<i>No...</i>

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:34.650
<i>I just can't do this!</i>

00:13:35.520 --> 00:13:37.180
<i>I'll start traveling.</i>

00:13:37.180 --> 00:13:40.170
<i>Traveling somewhere far away!</i>

00:13:41.590 --> 00:13:42.880
Kasuga-kun,

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.660
good morning.

00:13:49.530 --> 00:13:51.220
We switched to summer uniforms today.

00:13:55.910 --> 00:13:56.880
Yeah.

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:02.460
Thank you for visiting yesterday.

00:14:03.670 --> 00:14:05.760
Sorry about the weird stuff I said...

00:14:06.480 --> 00:14:08.110
But I feel better now.

00:14:09.770 --> 00:14:12.620
Once again, I look forward to our relationship.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:14.600
Saeki-san...

00:14:16.100 --> 00:14:17.920
I-I...

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:21.060
I... I'm...

00:14:22.060 --> 00:14:24.100
Kasuga-kun, what's wrong?

00:14:24.100 --> 00:14:25.240
We'll be late.

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:25.840
Eh?

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.410
Huh? It's kind of noisy.

00:14:53.990 --> 00:14:55.240
I wonder why.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:57.700
Has something happened?

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.560
What is this?

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.410
Nanako...

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:36.330
<b>Saeki</b>

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:38.810
Huh?

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.270
No way... It's mine?

00:15:50.720 --> 00:15:51.990
Why?

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:58.270
<b>Pervert</b>

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.260
Nanako...

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:58.970
Kasuga!

00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:00.930
This is crazy!

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:02.350
It's a huge mess!

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:03.650
Look at this!

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:08.380
That sick bastard came back!

00:16:08.380 --> 00:16:09.500
He came back!

00:16:09.910 --> 00:16:12.090
Scary!

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:13.600
<b>Pervert</b>

00:16:12.520 --> 00:16:13.610
Huh?

00:16:13.610 --> 00:16:14.960
Hey, Yamada!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:16.560
Stop shouting like a fool!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:17.750
Huh? Why?

00:16:17.750 --> 00:16:19.880
Show a little consideration for Nanako!

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:24.060
<i>What?</i>

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:29.250
<i>Eh?</i>

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:38.390
<i>The ink covered up my name...</i>

00:16:57.420 --> 00:16:58.800
Attention, everyone!

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:00.450
Emergency assembly in the gym...

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:02.410
Get moving!

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:04.100
Emergency assembly?

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.680
Damn...

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.720
Nanako, can you stand?

00:17:21.840 --> 00:17:23.010
Are you okay?

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:35.490
So the 2-1 classroom

00:17:35.510 --> 00:17:38.380
has been heavily vandalized,

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:43.770
with textbooks and personal items 
having sustained damage.

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:47.770
At the moment, we do not have details...

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:50.100
Quiet! Keep it down!

00:17:52.810 --> 00:17:59.090
We will begin an investigation 
into this incident at once.

00:17:54.560 --> 00:17:56.330
Hey, isn't this crazy?

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:59.090
Something like this happening at our school?

00:17:56.330 --> 00:17:59.090
Hey! All of you!

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:00.880
Are reporters coming?

00:17:59.090 --> 00:18:02.620
When further details are known, 
all homeroom teachers will be contacted.

00:18:00.880 --> 00:18:01.950
No idea...

00:18:01.570 --> 00:18:02.830
Pay attention!

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.770
I hope they don't interview me.

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:09.190
You are all encouraged to remain calm

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:08.390
It's gotta be the same guy who was 
seen stealing Saeki-san's uniform.

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:09.990
It must be!

00:18:09.190 --> 00:18:20.020
and continue to conduct yourselves 
as students of this school should.

00:18:09.990 --> 00:18:12.820
That creep with glasses...

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:14.780
What if I get attacked?

00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:16.660
I feel bad for Nanako.

00:18:16.660 --> 00:18:18.800
Everyone had almost forgotten about it.

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:26.700
In the interest of safety, students are 
to go home in groups beginning today.

00:18:28.080 --> 00:18:29.780
I heard some pervert was responsible.

00:18:29.780 --> 00:18:31.030
Will they ever catch him?

00:18:31.030 --> 00:18:32.770
I heard it was some nerd with glasses.

00:18:31.950 --> 00:18:34.050
They said "pervert" was written everywhere.

00:18:34.050 --> 00:18:35.200
Gross...

00:18:37.290 --> 00:18:38.970
Is 2-1 on the third floor?

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:40.390
Let's go have a look.

00:18:40.390 --> 00:18:41.460
I bet it was you.

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:42.830
Figured me out, huh?

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:43.840
I'm glad it wasn't our class.

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:45.270
I feel bad for 2-1.

00:19:17.430 --> 00:19:18.670
Kasuga-kun...

00:19:22.370 --> 00:19:24.260
Relieved that your secret's safe?

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:26.710
Nakamura-san...

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:35.470
I haven't felt this good in a long time!

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:37.420
Did you see the looks on their faces?

00:19:40.540 --> 00:19:41.820
Be proud.

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:44.200
You finally dropped the first layer of your mask.

00:20:04.150 --> 00:20:05.220
Kasuga-kun?

00:20:19.480 --> 00:20:20.780
Saeki-san...

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:31.450
Let's break up.

00:20:44.760 --> 00:20:45.760
Why?

00:20:48.420 --> 00:20:49.640
I'm sorry.

00:20:49.640 --> 00:20:50.440
Goodbye!

00:20:50.440 --> 00:20:51.680
Kasuga-kun!

00:20:58.620 --> 00:20:59.710
The picture

00:21:01.570 --> 00:21:04.070
on the cover of <i>Flowers of Evil</i>...

00:21:08.700 --> 00:21:10.910
It was on the floor.

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:19.420
<b>Flowers of Evil 
Baudelaire</b>

00:21:16.420 --> 00:21:19.420
You did it, didn't you?

00:21:22.520 --> 00:21:24.130
The classroom...

00:21:25.480 --> 00:21:28.700
My gym uniform...

00:21:35.520 --> 00:21:38.230
It was all you, wasn't it?

00:23:21.610 --> 00:23:24.030
Don't you like me anymore?

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:23.760
You're late.

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:24.230
I want to run away...

00:23:23.760 --> 00:23:27.250
I wonder what that gym uniform went through.

00:23:24.030 --> 00:23:25.400
I don't understand!

00:23:25.400 --> 00:23:28.640
I don't understand how you feel!

00:23:25.580 --> 00:23:28.640
Because Kasuga-kun is sick to the core.

00:23:27.620 --> 00:23:28.640
Come out, you freak!

00:23:28.020 --> 00:23:31.000
To some town where nobody knows me...

00:23:28.640 --> 00:23:31.010
My task is exposing that.

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:32.750
I'm sorry!

00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:34.440
Looks like a pervert to me.

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:36.060
I have nowhere to go.

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:40.980
<b>Rock, paper... Scissors! 
